# ==========================================
# 1. LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (Single-User Mode)
# ==========================================
# Used as a fallback or for local testing via stdio transport.
# Session cookie can be found in the network tab in browser developer tools
# Example: SESSION_COOKIE="JSESSIONID=1234567890abcdef; other_cookie=xyz"
SESSION_COOKIE="YOUR_COOKIE_STRING_HERE"

# ==========================================
# 2. SERVER DEPLOYMENT (Multi-User Mode)
# ==========================================
# For multi-user deployment, uncomment and configure these:
# MCP_TRANSPORT=streamable-http
# MCP_HOST=0.0.0.0
# MCP_PORT=8000
#
# Note: In HTTP mode, the SESSION_COOKIE env var is ignored for requests 
# that provide the 'x-tms-cookie' HTTP header.
